{
  "declaredLength": 2312,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也來當卡友啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F4F867576536153CB55663002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當卡友當卡友！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7576536153CB7576536153CBFF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不識相的假貨。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8B5876F8768450478CA8300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卡娜莉才不會說那種話。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53615A1C8389624D4E0D67038AAA90A37A2E8A71300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳真內行。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B3771F5167884C300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但要讓更多人知道卡娜莉的魅力，\n剛剛的方法也算行得通吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4689818B9366F4591A4EBA77E5905353615A1C838976849B45529BFF0C000A525B525B768465B96CD54E5F7B97884C5F97901A5427FF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不需要新卡友。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D9700898165B0536153CB300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只有發自內心喜愛卡娜莉的人，\n才有成為卡友的資格。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA6709767C81EA51675FC3559C611B53615A1C838976844EBAFF0C000A624D6709621070BA536153CB76848CC7683C300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那可不行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A353EF4E0D884CFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是只有花錢花時間才是粉絲，\n就算只是好像有點喜歡，粉絲就是粉絲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F53EA670982B1932282B166429593624D662F7C897D72FF0C000A5C317B9753EA662F597D50CF67099EDE559C6B61FF0C7C897D725C31662F7C897D72300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唔……\n要我忍受新卡友？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "551420262026000A898162115FCD53D765B0536153CBFF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "爺爺！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "723A723AFF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我也懂沐淨的心情，\n但我不希望你們吵架啊～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662114E5F61C26C906DE876845FC360C5FF0C000A4F4662114E0D5E0C671B4F605011543567B6554AFF5E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也是！訓練家之間有紛爭的話，\n那不就該打場寶可夢對戰嗎！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F662FFF018A137DF45BB64E4B959367097D1B722D76848A71FF0C000A90A34E0D5C318A72625358345BF653EF59225C0D623055CEFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下次再說",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6B21518D8AAA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我打一場吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B93621162534E0058345427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身為一名卡友，\n我要證明我的愛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB70BA4E00540D536153CBFF0C000A621189818B49660E62117684611B300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然不想讓爺爺為所欲為，\n但我想和沐淨對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671364E0D60F38B93723A723A70BA62406B3270BAFF0C000A4F46621160F3548C6C906DE85C0D62303002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我實際上也算是卡娜莉了。\n能和兩個卡娜莉對戰，簡直是賺到了吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BE6969B4E0A4E5F7B97662F53615A1C83894E863002000A80FD548C5169500B53615A1C83895C0D6230FF0C7C2176F4662F8CFA52304E865427300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂，來對戰啦！\n機會難得啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582FF0C4F865C0D62305566FF01000A6A5F670396E35F97554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我就跟你們交交手，\n但勝利會是我的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C318DDF4F6050114EA44EA4624BFF0C000A4F4652DD52296703662F62117684FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是想做什麼啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F60F3505A4EC09EBC554AFF1F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是我們贏了，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們的夥伴也通通要成為卡友！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F621150118D0F4E86FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35011768459254F344E5F901A901A8981621070BA536153CBFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身為一名卡友，\n我要展現我的愛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB70BA4E00540D536153CBFF0C000A621189815C5573FE62117684611B300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這回我要真正地認真啦！\n用超級進化一飛衝天吧，麻麻鰻魚王！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901956DE62118981771F6B6357308A8D771F5566FF01000A75288D857D1A903253164E0098DB885D59295427FF0C9EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738BFF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了實現我的策略，\n超級進化吧，龍頭地鼠！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E865BE673FE621176847B567565FF0C000A8D857D1A903253165427FF0C9F8D982D57309F20FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶燈火靈……\n用超級進化來展現我們的愛吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C34667671C8706B974820262026000A75288D857D1A903253164F865C5573FE621150117684611B5427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可是個認真的卡友……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF662F500B8A8D771F7684536153CB20262026FF0100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沐淨……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C906DE820262026001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過卡娜莉的魅力\n應該讓更多人知道。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E53615A1C838976849B45529B000A61C98A728B9366F4591A4EBA77E59053300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉絲的確很重要，\n但沐淨對我來說更重要。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C897D72768478BA5F8891CD8981FF0C000A4F466C906DE85C0D62114F868AAA66F491CD89813002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……♡<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF20262026266100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過用全像卡娜莉騙人，\n這一點不可取。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E7528516850CF53615A1C83899A194EBAFF0C000A90194E009EDE4E0D53EF53D6300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你聽到了吧？\n爺爺！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60807D52304E865427FF1F000A723A723AFF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來吧，\n這個給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F865427FF0C000A9019500B7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B350113002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n另一種顏色的卡娜莉裝扮服飾組合！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A53E64E007A2E984F8272768453615A1C838988DD626E670D98FE7D445408FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽說在美髮沙龍\n有人模仿我的髮型呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8AAA57287F8E9AEE6C999F8D000A67094EBA6A214EFF621176849AEE578B54623002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那還真是讓人頭疼……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39084771F662F8B934EBA982D75BC2026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沐淨當然不用說，\n順便今後請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也多指教啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C906DE8757671364E0D75288AAAFF0C000A98064FBF4ECA5F8C8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F591A630765595566FF01001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，還真贏不了<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>呢。\n麻麻鰻魚王牠們明明也做了很多鍛鍊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C9084771F8D0F4E0D4E86001000020100000054623002000A9EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738B72605011660E660E4E5F505A4E865F88591A935B934A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了讓更多人加入粉絲俱樂部，\n接下來我該做什麼樣的周邊好呢～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E868B9366F4591A4EBA52A051657C897D724FF16A0290E8FF0C000A63A54E0B4F8662118A72505A4EC09EBC6A2376845468908A597D5462FF5E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
